      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for mumbai to deheadum mover</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When moving from Mumbai to Deheadum, compliance with statutory transit paperwork and robust risk coverage is essential for a smooth relocation. The first requirement is the GST e‑Way bill, a digital permit that authorises the transport of goods across state borders. This document ensures that all GST obligations are met and helps avoid customs delays.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Next, the IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty) is mandatory; it records the cargo details, weight, and destination, providing legal proof of the shipment and protecting both the sender and the carrier against disputes.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Finally, a comprehensive 100% declared‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance covers accidental collision or unforeseen delays, guaranteeing full compensation for any loss or damage during transit.</span></li></ul>

<p>For those looking at specific moving services, here’s how the coverage applies across various scenarios:</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>Mumbai to Kolhapur packers and movers charges</strong> – The e‑Way bill and LR/Bilty cover the entire journey, while the marine insurance protects the goods during the 500‑km route.</li>
<li><strong>Movers and packers near Sion Mumbai</strong> – Local agents can issue the required documents quickly, ensuring that even short‑haul moves meet compliance.</li>
<li><strong>Bike transport in Airoli Navi Mumbai</strong> – The LR/Bilty records the bike’s details, and the insurance covers any accidental collision on the road.</li>
<li><strong>Home shifters in Bangore</strong> – When moving out of the city, the e‑Way bill facilitates interstate transport, and the insurance covers delays caused by traffic or weather.</li>
<li><strong>Furniture movers US</strong> – International shipments require the same e‑Way and LR/Bilty, with marine insurance covering sea transit risks.</li>
<li><strong>Part furniture to be shifted from Mumbai to Talegaon Dabhade</strong> – The documents streamline the local move, while insurance protects against accidental damage during loading and unloading.</li>
<li><strong>Transport your home furniture</strong> – Every piece is logged in the LR/Bilty, and the 100% declared‑value insurance ensures full coverage.</li>
